v2 changelog
============

Running log of every change made toward v2 (the soldier-swarm
rebuild). One entry per change. WHAT + WHY, kept short.

Plan of record: port.md
Lessons from v1:    lessons.md

When v2 moves to its own repo, this file moves with it as the
seed of that repo's CHANGELOG / dev_log.

---

2026-05-09  port.md: add Pillar #6 (dual-scale view)
  WHAT: Added a 6th pillar to port.md and reflected it in
        milestone 1's render scope. One simulation, two view
        scales: zoom out for strategic blob-view, zoom in for
        tactical soldier-sprite view. Smooth pinch / scroll
        between them, no mode switch. Battles short.
  WHY:  User requirement — "Total War vibe but simple, battles
        won't be long." Captured before any code so the renderer
        is designed dual-scale from commit 1 (per lesson #1:
        visual style locks the engine).

---

2026-05-09  port plan + lessons committed
  WHAT: Created port.md (the v2 plan of record), lessons.md
        (12 lessons distilled from v1), and this file.
  WHY:  Anchor the rebuild before any v2 code is written. Three
        pivots in v1 happened without a written plan; this is the
        guardrail against repeating that. Every subsequent v2
        change appends an entry below.

